1718
01:13:09.570 --> 01:13:11.670
Speaking of the script, I have a script catch.
说到剧本，我发现了一个剧本上的小细节。

1719
01:13:12.030 --> 01:13:14.390
So, you know, in the scene, we set the box on fire.
在那个场景里，我们把盒子点着了。

1720
01:13:14.630 --> 01:13:17.590
In the shooting draft of the script, we buried the bird.
但在拍摄用的剧本初稿里，我们是把鸟埋了。

1721
01:13:18.310 --> 01:13:22.890
There was a scene where Michael and Dwight are digging a hole outside, and then we all
原本有一场戏是迈克尔和德怀特在外面挖坑，然后我们所有人

1722
01:13:22.890 --> 01:13:24.050
gather around this hole.
围在坑边。

1723
01:13:24.550 --> 01:13:27.390
And it got changed to fire, but I don't know why.
后来改成了火葬，但我不知道为什么。

1724
01:13:27.390 --> 01:13:33.870
I think maybe, Angela, there was really no grass in this area that we shot.
我想可能是因为，安吉拉，我们拍摄的那块地方根本没有草地。

1725
01:13:33.870 --> 01:13:34.750
We had no grass.
我们没有草地。

1726
01:13:34.930 --> 01:13:39.830
There was a hedge with maybe, like, I don't know, three feet of dirt.
那里只有一道树篱，大概只有三英尺宽的泥地。

1727
01:13:40.230 --> 01:13:42.630
Like, yeah, there was, I mean, not even.
对，没错，我是说，甚至连三英尺都没有。

1728
01:13:42.850 --> 01:13:47.630
There is a deleted scene where Michael and Dwight are trying to dig a hole there, and
有一个删减片段是迈克尔和德怀特试图在那里挖坑，然后

1729
01:13:47.630 --> 01:13:50.310
then the business on the other side yells at them, and they run away.
另一边的人冲他们大喊大叫，他们就跑开了。

1730
01:13:51.090 --> 01:13:52.390
Oh, okay.
噢，原来如此。

1731
01:13:52.750 --> 01:13:53.610
Well, there you go.
好吧，真相大白了。

1732
01:13:53.610 --> 01:13:57.390
Well, we had another fan question about this fire, then.
那我们还有另一个关于这场火的粉丝提问。

1733
01:13:57.770 --> 01:14:01.590
Clara Johnson wants to know, did you actually set the bird on fire?
克拉拉·约翰逊想知道，你们是真的把那只鸟点着了吗？

1734
01:14:02.450 --> 01:14:02.970
Yes.
是的。

1735
01:14:03.150 --> 01:14:04.710
Real fire, fake bird.
火是真的，鸟是假的。

1736
01:14:04.970 --> 01:14:10.110
Kent told me they had to hire a special effects guy to oversee the fire and the extinguishing,
肯特告诉我，他们必须雇一个特效人员来监督点火和灭火过程，

1737
01:14:10.110 --> 01:14:13.570
and they had to get a special permit to be allowed to set the fire.
而且他们必须申请特别许可才能获准点火。

1738
01:14:13.750 --> 01:14:15.830
And he said we did three takes.
他说我们拍了三次。

1739
01:14:16.450 --> 01:14:17.670
Three takes of the fire.
火烧了三次。

1740
01:14:17.670 --> 01:14:22.950
And Phil told me, though, that the special effects guys were worried that the fake dead
不过菲尔告诉我，特效人员担心那只假死鸟

1741
01:14:22.950 --> 01:14:25.990
bird might give off toxic fumes when it burned.
在燃烧时可能会产生有毒烟雾。

1742
01:14:26.030 --> 01:14:30.630
So they actually took it out of the box and just put a wad of toilet paper in there.
所以他们实际上把它从盒子里拿了出来，只放了一团卫生纸进去。

1743
01:14:30.990 --> 01:14:32.930
Oh, not toilet paper.
噢，别提卫生纸。

1744
01:14:33.770 --> 01:14:34.750
I know.
我知道。

1745
01:14:35.450 --> 01:14:36.030
Too soon.
太早了。

1746
01:14:36.130 --> 01:14:36.180
I know.
我知道。

1747
01:14:36.370 --> 01:14:37.190
Too soon, Angela.
太早了，安吉拉。

1748
01:14:37.490 --> 01:14:37.970
Too soon.
太早了。

1749
01:14:39.530 --> 01:14:43.950
And then finally, we had a fan catch from Peter K.
最后，我们收到了彼得·K的一个粉丝发现。

1750
01:14:43.950 --> 01:14:47.990
